# Tees Admin Desk Website

Static website for **Tees Admin Desk**, a local admin-support business for small Teesside and North East businesses.

Brand tagline: **Paperwork â€¢ Deadlines â€¢ Systems**

Main services:
- Contractor paperwork support
- Trade lead and quote follow-up
- Spreadsheet-to-system support
- Landlord / HMO admin

## Visual Style

The site has a clean white/off-white background, dark navy headings, teal buttons and highlights, rounded cards, subtle shadows, and a calm, trustworthy B2B feel. The homepage includes a dashboard card in the hero and a dark navy CTA block near the bottom.

Main colours:
- `#17273D`
- `#091A31`
- `#10AFAB`
- `#F7F9FB`
- `#FFFFFF`
- `#DDE6EA`
- `#5F6B7A`

## File Structure

- `index.html` - lightweight homepage shell with head/meta/CSS links and module script.
- `styles.css` - CSS entry file; imports the split files in `css/`.
- `css/` - split CSS files for variables, reset, layout, sections, components, and responsive rules.
- `contact.html` - standalone contact page.
- `contractor-paperwork.html` - standalone service page for contractor paperwork.
- `assets/Logo.png` - site logo used by the header and footer.
- `js/main.js` - imports components/sections and renders the homepage.
- `js/components/` - reusable template-string components.
- `js/sections/` - homepage section templates rendered in order.

## CSS Structure

`index.html`, `contact.html`, and `contractor-paperwork.html` still link only to `styles.css`. That file should stay as the CSS entry/import file.

- `css/variables.css` - root colour, shadow, radius, and container variables.
- `css/reset.css` - reset and base element styles.
- `css/layout.css` - shared layout helpers such as `.container`.
- `css/header.css` - header, navigation, logo, and brand styles.
- `css/buttons.css` - shared button styles, including `.btn` and `.header-cta`.
- `css/hero.css` - hero layout, copy, eyebrow, trust line, and hero actions.
- `css/dashboard.css` - hero dashboard card, metrics, priorities, dots, and status pills.
- `css/sections.css` - generic section spacing and section heading styles.
- `css/cards.css` - problem cards, service cards, shared card styles, icons, and learn links.
- `css/why.css` - Why Tees Admin Desk section layout.
- `css/process.css` - How it works/process section layout.
- `css/who-we-help.css` - Who we help card and audience pills.
- `css/cta.css` - final CTA block and illustration shapes.
- `css/footer.css` - footer layout, logo, links, and disclaimer.
- `css/responsive.css` - all media queries and responsive behaviour.

## Homepage Section Map

- **Header**  
  File: `js/components/Header.js`  
  Contains the logo, brand text, navigation, and header CTA.  
  Main classes: `site-header`, `header-inner`, `brand`, `brand-logo`, `brand-copy`, `brand-name`, `brand-tagline`, `site-nav`, `header-cta`

- **Hero**  
  File: `js/sections/HeroSection.js`  
  Contains the main headline, intro text, trust line, hero buttons, and dashboard card.  
  Main classes: `hero`, `hero-grid`, `hero-copy`, `eyebrow`, `hero-text`, `trust-line`, `hero-actions`, `btn`, `btn-primary`, `btn-secondary`

- **Problem**  
  File: `js/sections/ProblemSection.js`  
  Contains the messy-admin intro and problem cards.  
  Main classes: `section`, `problem-section`, `section-heading`, `problem-grid`, `problem-card`, `card-icon`

- **Services**  
  File: `js/sections/ServicesSection.js`  
  Contains the four main service cards.  
  Main classes: `section`, `services-section`, `section-heading`, `services-grid`, `service-card`, `service-icon`, `learn-link`

- **Why Tees Admin Desk**  
  File: `js/sections/WhySection.js`  
  Contains the benefit items: done-for-you, local, practical, and flexible.  
  Main classes: `section`, `why-section`, `section-heading`, `why-grid`, `why-item`, `why-icon`

- **How It Works**  
  File: `js/sections/ProcessSection.js`  
  Contains the three-step process.  
  Main classes: `section`, `process-section`, `section-heading`, `process-grid`, `process-step`, `step-number`, `step-icon`

- **Who We Help**  
  File: `js/sections/WhoWeHelpSection.js`  
  Contains the audience list for local businesses and admin-heavy SMEs.  
  Main classes: `section`, `who-section`, `who-card`, `section-label`, `who-list`

- **Final CTA**  
  File: `js/sections/FinalCtaSection.js`  
  Contains the dark navy call-to-action block and decorative folder/checklist shapes.  
  Main classes: `section`, `final-cta`, `cta-card`, `cta-content`, `cta-note`, `cta-illustration`, `folder-shape`, `checklist-shape`

- **Footer**  
  File: `js/components/Footer.js`  
  Contains the footer logo, contact links, and disclaimer.  
  Main classes: `site-footer`, `footer-grid`, `footer-brand`, `footer-logo`, `footer-contact`, `footer-disclaimer`

## Component Map

- `js/components/Header.js` - renders the full site header; used by `js/main.js`.
- `js/components/Footer.js` - renders the full footer; used by `js/main.js`.
- `js/components/Button.js` - renders shared button links; used by hero and final CTA sections.
- `js/components/DashboardCard.js` - renders the admin overview dashboard; used by `HeroSection.js`.
- `js/components/ServiceCard.js` - renders one service card; used by `ServicesSection.js`.
- `js/components/ProblemCard.js` - renders one problem card; used by `ProblemSection.js`.
- `js/components/BenefitItem.js` - renders one benefit item; used by `WhySection.js`.
- `js/components/ProcessStep.js` - renders one process step; used by `ProcessSection.js`.

## Editing Guide

To change header/nav/logo:
- `js/components/Header.js`
- header styles in `css/header.css`
- button/CTA styles in `css/buttons.css`

To change hero text:
- `js/sections/HeroSection.js`
- hero styles in `css/hero.css`

To change dashboard:
- `js/components/DashboardCard.js`
- dashboard styles in `css/dashboard.css`

To change services:
- `js/sections/ServicesSection.js`
- `js/components/ServiceCard.js`
- service styles in `css/cards.css`

To change problem cards:
- `js/sections/ProblemSection.js`
- `js/components/ProblemCard.js`
- problem styles in `css/cards.css`

To change â€œHow it worksâ€:
- `js/sections/ProcessSection.js`
- `js/components/ProcessStep.js`
- process styles in `css/process.css`

To change final CTA:
- `js/sections/FinalCtaSection.js`
- CTA styles in `css/cta.css`

To change footer:
- `js/components/Footer.js`
- footer styles in `css/footer.css`

To change mobile layout:
- media queries in `css/responsive.css`

## Rules

- Keep plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.
- Do not add frameworks or build tools.
- Keep the `assets/Logo.png` path unless the logo file is renamed everywhere.
- Keep `contact.html` and `contractor-paperwork.html`.
- Do not touch `.git`.
- Keep anchors working: `#services`, `#how-it-works`, `#who-we-help`, `#about`.
- Update this README when the structure changes.

## Preview

Use VS Code Live Server to preview the site. Directly opening `index.html` may not work properly because JavaScript modules are used.


